         <div type="entry" xml:id="SRO5992">
                  <head rend="left">
                     <persName n="aldeemaster" role="stationer enterer">Master <surname>Aldee</surname>
                     </persName> /</head>
                  <p>Entred for his Copy by direccon from <persName n="lownesmasterwarden" role="stationer">master <surname>Lownes</surname>
                     Warden</persName> vnder
his handwritinge to be printed when it is translated and further
lawfully aucthorised, A placurt or proclamacon called, <title>
                        <foreign>Placcaet van
                     de Hooghe ende Mogende, heeren Staten generaell der vereenichde Nederlanden Inhendende order, waer near de Jesuijten priestes, ende
                     Monicken van de Pausselijcke ofte Roomische Religie inde selue landen
                     kamende hen sullen dragen &amp;c. </foreign>
                     </title>
                     
                     <seg type="fee" rend="roman-numerals aligned-right"><!--processing: vjd-->
                        <num type="totalPence" value="6"><!--orig: vjd-->
                           <num type="pence" value="6">vj<hi rend="superscript">d</hi>
                           </num>
                        </num>
                     </seg>
                  </p>
